<HelpTab>
    <HelpSection Title="Conditions (Only if)">
        <FluentText>
            Conditions are optional. A rule only runs if every condition is true at the moment it's triggered.
            Times and days are UK venue time.
        </FluentText>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Time of day is between</strong> two times. An end before the start runs past midnight.</li>
            <li><strong>Day of week is</strong> one of the days you tick.</li>
            <li><strong>A kiosk is or isn't in a game</strong> right now.</li>
            <li><strong>A location is open or closed</strong>, using its opening hours from Companies &amp; Locations.
                A location with no hours set counts as closed.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Actions">
        <FluentText>Each action has a <strong>Target Client</strong>, the kiosk it acts on:</FluentText>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Music Control</strong>: change the music, for example play a playlist.</li>
            <li><strong>Start Projection Program</strong> and <strong>Stop Projection Program</strong>: on a chosen screen,
                or the client's default.</li>
            <li><strong>Projection Program Control</strong>: Start, Stop, Pause, Resume, Skip to Next Step or Skip to
                Previous Step on what's already running.</li>
            <li><strong>DMX Scene Control</strong>: Start Scene, Stop Scene or Stop All Scenes. <strong>Hold for (ms)</strong>
                stops it after a while. Leave it blank to run until stopped.</li>
            <li><strong>Play Audio Clip</strong>: play a clip over the music.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
